    "created_at": "2018-01-29T18:07:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-29T18:07:41Z",
    "body": "No, the data: URL generator should just encode the input and not apply MIME type-specific processing. Then it would no longer be generic. It's given a MIME type because data: URLs contain a MIME type in their representation.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
