    "created_at": "2018-01-29T18:35:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-29T18:35:04Z",
    "body": "Perhaps the mention of MIME type is being  misinterpreted. The inquiry is as to how the MIME type is derived from the input, not specific processing for a given MIME type the is either passed the to `toDataURL()` or determined by the algorithm. \r\n\r\nIf the processor algorithm determines the MIME type of the input file there is no reason for a MIME type to be passed as argument to `toDataURL()`.",
